        {
          "kind": "text",
          "value": "Explanation: Class 9: E[girls from C9] = (C(3,1)C(1,1)/C(4,2))×1 + (C(3,2)C(1,0)/C(4,2))×2 = (3/6)×1 + (3/6)×2 =\n1/2 + 1 = 3/2. Class 10: E[girls from C10] = (C(1,1)C(5,1)/C(6,2))×1 = 5/15 = 1/3. E[G] = 3/2 + 1/3 = 11/6 ≈ 1.833.\nAnswer range: 1.81–1.85."
        },
