          "value": "Explanation: (1/30) × C(n,3)(1/2)^n = C(n,2)(1/2)^n. Simplify: C(n,3)/30 = C(n,2). C(n,3) = n(n-1)(n-2)/6. C(n,2) =\nn(n-1)/2. So n(n-1)(n-2)/(6×30) = n(n-1)/2. Cancel n(n-1): (n-2)/180 = 1/2. n-2 = 90. n = 92."
